    "canonicalType": "KnowledgeStatement",
    "label": "可控性矩阵的计算数值精度较差，这种问题也会延续到阿克曼公式中。函数 acker 可用于状态变量数目较少（≤10）的单输入单输出（SISO）系统。",
    "aliases": [],
    "description": "Computation of the controllability matrix has very poor numerical accuracy, and this carries over to Ackermann's formula. The function acker can be used for SISO systems with a small (≤10) number of state-variables.",
